WEBVTT

00:00:12.393 --> 00:00:14.316
<v><b>Judge 1:</b></v> Dan, Amy, and Naomi,

00:00:14.793 --> 00:00:15.812
come and stand here.

00:00:22.081 --> 00:00:23.678
OK, Amy.

00:00:24.278 --> 00:00:26.246
Very nervous in the beginning!

00:00:27.033 --> 00:00:29.693
But in the end, very good!

00:00:30.647 --> 00:00:34.261
<v><b>Judge 2:</b></v> Yes, a great performance. Well done.

00:00:35.787 --> 00:00:36.507
<v><b>Judge 1:</b></v> Dan.

00:00:37.628 --> 00:00:40.603
In a word... “terrible!”

00:00:43.660 --> 00:00:45.332
<v><b>Judge 2:</b></v> Dan, I’m sorry.

00:00:45.968 --> 00:00:50.990
You’re good-looking, you move well, but you can’t sing!

00:00:53.918 --> 00:00:58.930
<v><b>Judge 1:</b></v> Naomi. Uh…you’re OK.

00:00:59.216 --> 00:01:01.286
You have a nice voice.

00:01:03.281 --> 00:01:08.141
<v><b>Judge 2:</b></v> Naomi, you have a good voice, but I can’t hear the feeling.

00:01:10.814 --> 00:01:15.757
<v><b>Judge 1:</b></v> OK. Dan and Naomi. Thank you very much, but no, thank you.

00:01:17.004 --> 00:01:20.840
Amy, congratulations! See you on the show next week.

00:01:20.864 --> 00:01:23.004
<v><b>Amy:</b></v> Fantastic! That’s great.

00:01:23.446 --> 00:01:24.295
Thank you!

00:01:24.319 --> 00:01:25.174
Thank you!